1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,610
Salesman phone se hi visit aur order record kar sakta hai.

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:08,838
Ek customer pe pahunche, app kholiye, customer select kariye, Record Visit dabaaein.

3
00:00:08,838 --> 00:00:11,328
Location automatic capture ho jaati hai.

4
00:00:11,328 --> 00:00:14,129
Agar order milta hai — Create Order dabaaiye.

5
00:00:14,129 --> 00:00:16,806
Items add kariye, quantity daaliye, submit.

6
00:00:16,806 --> 00:00:20,727
Yeh order Tally mein bhi automatically sync ho jaayega raat ko.

7
00:00:20,727 --> 00:00:24,586
Digital record milta hai — kab kaun kahaan gaya, kya bik gaya.

8
00:00:24,586 --> 00:00:28,197
Owner ke liye transparency, salesman ke liye productivity.

9
00:00:28,197 --> 00:00:28,943
Sabka fayda.
